---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="License & Contractor Compliance Platform — Case Study | Syntegreti" description="Building the License & Contractor Compliance Platform for one of America's largest home-improvement platforms — jurisdiction monitoring, AI document verification, and a pre-computed compliance engine, delivered against contractual milestones.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-24 pb-8 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-20"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-animate>
        <a href="/case-studies" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors mb-6">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
          </svg>
          All Case Studies
        </a>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-accent">
            Home Improvement · Nationwide US
          </span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1 text-xs text-text-muted">Contractor Compliance</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-amber/30 bg-amber/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-amber">In delivery</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
          License &amp; Contractor Compliance Platform
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          We are building the compliance backbone for
          <strong class="text-text-primary">one of America's largest
          home-improvement platforms</strong> — keeping thousands of contractor
          licenses and insurance documents verified across state, county and city
          jurisdictions, delivered milestone by milestone against a contractual
          acceptance plan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fact strip -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4" data-stagger>
        {[
          { value: 'Active', label: 'In delivery', sub: 'milestone-based build' },
          { value: '2 portals', label: 'Admin + contractor', sub: 'one platform' },
          { value: '3-level', label: 'Jurisdiction coverage', sub: 'state · county · city' },
          { value: 'In SOW', label: 'AI accuracy SLA', sub: 'contractual, not claimed' },
        ].map((m) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5 p-5 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent">{m.value}</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-text-primary">{m.label}</div>
            {m.sub && <div class="mt-0.5 text-[13px] text-text-secondary">{m.sub}</div>}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Challenge -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-5">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2" data-animate>
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-rose">// the_challenge</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
            Thousands of contractors.<br />
            Hundreds of jurisdictions.<br />
            <span class="text-rose">One compliance team.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-3" data-animate>
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            {[
              { title: 'Fragmented rules', desc: 'Every state, county and city writes its own licensing requirements — and changes them without telling anyone.' },
              { title: 'Manual verification', desc: 'Licenses and certificates of insurance checked by hand, document by document.' },
              { title: 'Expiry risk', desc: 'A lapsed license found late means stopped jobs and real regulatory exposure.' },
              { title: 'No single answer', desc: '"Is this contractor compliant for this job, here, today?" took research, not a lookup.' },
            ].map((challenge) => (
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-rose/20 bg-rose/5 p-6">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary">{challenge.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-muted">{challenge.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Solution -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="mb-8" data-animate>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">// the_solution</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          What We Built
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6" data-stagger>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface/20 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
            <!-- Solution 1 -->
            <div class="border-b border-border p-8 lg:border-r">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5">
                  <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">01</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Jurisdiction Monitoring</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                Licensing requirements tracked across <strong>state, county and city jurisdictions</strong> —
                with durable Temporal workflows watching the authoritative sources for change.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">Temporal.io</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Solution 2 -->
            <div class="border-b border-border p-8">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5">
                  <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">02</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">AI Document Verification</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                Licenses and certificates of insurance read by <strong>AI/OCR extraction</strong>,
                with accuracy targets agreed in the contract — not marketing copy.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">GPT-4o</span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">FastAPI</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Solution 3 -->
            <div class="border-b border-border p-8 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5">
                  <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">03</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Compliance Status Engine</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                Contractor compliance is <strong>pre-computed at write time</strong>, so the answer to
                "can this contractor work this job in this county?" is instant.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">NestJS</span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">Redis</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Solution 4 -->
            <div class="p-8">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-accent/20 bg-accent/5">
                  <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">04</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Two Portals, One Platform</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
                An <strong>admin portal for the compliance team</strong> and a self-service portal
                for contractors — onboarding, document upload, and status in one place.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">Next.js</span>
                <span class="rounded-md bg-cyan/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-cyan">Mapbox</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-deep p-1" data-animate>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-border">
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-rose/60"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber/60"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-accent/60"></div>
          <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">architecture — contractor-compliance-platform</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            {[
              { label: 'Portals', items: ['Next.js 15', 'React 19', 'Mapbox GL JS'], color: 'cyan' },
              { label: 'Platform API', items: ['NestJS 11', 'PostgreSQL 16', 'Redis'], color: 'cyan' },
              { label: 'AI-OCR Service', items: ['FastAPI', 'GPT-4o Extraction'], color: 'cyan' },
              { label: 'Orchestration', items: ['Temporal.io', 'Durable Monitoring Pipelines'], color: 'cyan' },
            ].map((group) => (
              <div>
                <span class={`block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-${group.color} mb-3`}>{group.label}</span>
                <div class="space-y-1.5">
                  {group.items.map((item) => (
                    <div class="rounded-md border border-border bg-void/50 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-xs text-text-muted">{item}</div>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Accountability -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-accent/10 bg-surface/30 p-10" data-animate>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">// accountability</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Results will be reported when they're real</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          This platform is in delivery, so you won't find outcome numbers on this
          page yet. What's already in place says more: contractual acceptance
          criteria per milestone, an AI extraction accuracy SLA, a hypercare
          period with defined response times, and full IP transfer to the client
          at go-live. We publish results when the client has them — not before.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Methodology -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface/20 p-8" data-animate>
        <span class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">// how_we_delivered</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">The project started with working software, not a deck.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-text-secondary max-w-2xl">
          Before any contract, we built a full-stack proof of concept: both
          portals, the API, the AI/OCR extraction service and the Temporal
          workflow engine, running end to end. The client evaluated a system
          they could click through — then engaged us to build it out. That PoC
          became the foundation of the platform now in delivery, with the same
          team carrying it from proof to production.
        </p>
        <a href="/services/catalyst-studio" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-accent hover:text-accent-glow transition-colors">
          Learn about our Catalyst Studio
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-accent/20 bg-surface/30 p-12 text-center" data-animate>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          Have a compliance problem that looks like this?
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-text-secondary">
          Regulated, jurisdiction-heavy, document-driven — this is the work we pick
          first. Start with a 4-6 week proof.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-void transition-all hover:bg-accent-glow">
          Book a 4-6 Week Sprint
        </a>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="/case-studies" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">
            All Case Studies
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
